Invariant Thinking
          What local truth always stays valid?

          Example
              Trapping Rain Water

          How
              Instead of simulating whole water structure,focus on invariant:
              water at index i depends only on min(maxLeft, maxRight)

          Fails when
              Too much state is still being tracked or recomputed
              Example
                  DP problems like Decode Ways / Edit Distance

Brain understands local correctness, but still tracks too many possibilities/states,
so solution does not compress into minimal information.

          
            
